<Layout title="Privacy | A4 Code">
  <section class="container">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>A4 Code runs against a server you operate. Projects and threads are stored by that server. Your configured coding providers receive the prompts and context needed to run your requests. Optional services, such as A4 Connect and telemetry, use the endpoints the server operator configures. Review those services’ policies before enabling them.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/SilentHacks/a4code/blob/main/docs/user/remote-access.md">Remote access documentation</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
